    eligibility: 'Wonke umuntu ophila ne-HIV eNingizimu Afrika uyafaneleka ukuthola ama-ARV, kungakhathaliseki inani le-CD4, ubuzwe, noma isimo samaphepha. Izingane, abesifazane abakhulelwe, nabantu abane-TB bayasheshiswa. Akukho ukuhlolwa kwemali oyingenayo — ukwelashwa kumahhala. Abafuna indawo yokukhosela nabokufika abangenamaphepha bafakiwe ngokusobala ku-National Strategic Plan on HIV. Uma isikhungo senqaba ukukuqalisa, cela ukukhuluma nomphathi wesikhungo noma ushayele i-National AIDS Helpline ku-0800 012 322.',
