    realityCheck: 'Uhlelo lwama-ARV lungenye yempumelelo yangempela yezempilo yomphakathi eNingizimu Afrika. Ukutholakala kwemithi kuzinzile — ukuphela kwemithi ezweni lonke, okwake kwaba yinkinga enkulu, kube kungavamile kusukela ngo-2020 ngenxa yokuthengwa okuhlanganisiwe nge-National Department of Health. Lapho uhlelo luhluleka khona ukugcina iziguli ekunakekelweni: cishe amaphesenti angu-20% eziguli ayeka ukunakekelwa phakathi nonyaka wokuqala, imvamisa ngenxa yehlazo, izindleko zokugibela (u-R50-R100 ngohambo ngalunye lomtholampilo ezindaweni zasemakhaya), noma isikhathi eside sokulinda. I-CCMDD namakilabhu okunamathela ekwelashweni asizile, kodwa ukufinyelela akulingani — iGauteng neNtshonalanga Koloni zinezindawo zokulanda eziningi kakhulu kuneLimpopo noma iMpumalanga Koloni. Uma umtholampilo wakho njalo uphelelwa yimithi noma unesikhathi sokulinda esidlula amahora angu-4, unelungelo lokudlulisela ifayela lakho kunoma yimuphi omunye umtholampilo womphakathi — cela umphathi wesikhungo incwadi yokudluliselwa.',
