    eligibility: 'Noma ubani onezimpawu (ukukhwehlela okungaphezu kwamasonto angu-2, ukwehla kwesisindo, ukujuluka ebusuku, umkhuhlane) kufanele ahlolwe. Ukwelashwa kumahhala kuwo wonke umuntu — izakhamuzi, abokufika, nabantu abangenamaphepha. I-TB yisifo okumele sibikwe futhi ukusilapha kuvikela umphakathi wonke. Izinkampani zezimayini ziphoqelekile ngokomthetho ukuthi zihlole abasebenzi minyaka yonke futhi zinikeze ukwelashwa, kodwa abavukuzi abasemsebenzini ongahlelekile bavame ukushiywa ngaphandle.',
