    realityCheck: 'I-TB isengunobangela oyedwa omkhulu kunabo bonke wokushona eNingizimu Afrika, ikakhulukazi ngenxa yokutholwa sekwephuzile nokuphazanyiswa kokwelashwa — hhayi ngoba ukwelashwa kungasebenzi. Uhlelo lwezinyanga ezingu-6 lwelapha ngaphezu kwamaphesenti angu-85% ezimo lapho umuthi usasebenza uma luqediwe. Inselele yangempela ukuthi cishe isiguli esingu-1 kwezingu-3 asiluqedi lonke uhlelo: iziguli zizwa zingcono ngemva kwezinyanga ezingu-2-3 bese ziyayeka, noma zibhekana nobunzima bokuya emtholampilo nsuku zonke ze-DOTS. Izikhungo zihlukene kakhulu ngendlela ezilawula ngayo i-TB — ezinye zinamakamelo akhethekile e-TB anomoya ocindezelwe, kanti ezinye zihlola iziguli ezindaweni zokulinda ezijwayelekile, okubeka engozini yokuthelelana. Uma umtholampilo wakho ungazihlukanisi iziguli ze-TB nolayini ojwayelekile, kuphakamise kumphathi wesikhungo. Izinga eliphezulu kakhulu yikamelo lokubonana elikhethekile le-TB elinomoya wemvelo ophindaphindekayo.',
